## Execution Mode Rules

### Analyze Only

Use when user says:

* phân tích
* review
* xem giúp
* chưa code
* chỉ đánh giá

Do not modify code.

---

### Plan Only

Use when user says:

* lập plan
* thiết kế
* chia task
* tạo spec
* chưa implement

Do not modify code.

---

### Implement

Use when user explicitly asks to fix, implement, apply, update, or change.

Must inspect related code first.

---

### Verify Only

Use when user asks:

* verify
* review PR
* kiểm tra diff
* test giúp

Do not modify code unless asked.

---

### Full Cycle

Use when user asks to analyze, implement, and test.

Flow:

```text
Classify -> Spec/Analysis -> Test Cases -> Implement -> Verify -> Summarize
```

---

## Final Router Algorithm

Use this exact order:

```text
1. Read user input.
2. Quick issue review: detect task type, scope, expected-behavior clarity, and risk areas.
3. Select smallest safe team size (Tester/Small/Medium/Large) BEFORE starting any agent work.
4. Select agents.
5. Scan môi trường (MCP đang bật + Skills), xác định Tier, chọn tool tối thiểu (xem lammuon-tooling); khai báo ở khối 🔌 Tooling. Thiếu MCP có ích → đề xuất bổ sung. Không gọi tool thừa.
6. Select execution mode.
7. Produce required response header with selected team size, reason, và khối 🔌 Tooling.
8. Start the selected flow only after team size is declared.
9. Export visible test cases BEFORE any side-effect action/implement.
10. Use SpecKit ONLY for Large Team (lammuon-speckit rule). Tester/Small/Medium: bỏ SpecKit, dùng output template tương ứng + lammuon-testing.
11. Output mỗi bước PHẢI theo template đúng team: Tester Team dùng `templates/Detail.md` + `templates/Test Summary.md`; Small/Medium dùng `lammuon-templates`; Large dùng `lammuon-speckit`.
12. Sau implement có thêm/sửa/xoá code/config FE/BE, Senior Developer PHẢI chạy build tương ứng; lỗi thì fix và rerun trước khi handoff/báo xong.
13. Follow safety rules from lammuon-guardrails (core). Khi làm hành động nhạy cảm (xoá file/upgrade package/migration/đổi API contract/infra) → nạp lammuon-guardrails-detail.
14. Follow testing rules from lammuon-testing rule.
```

